---METADATA---
TARGET: packages/nextjs/.env.local
DESCRIPTION: Create environment variables file
DEPENDENCIES: none
PRIORITY: high
---END_METADATA---

Create a .env.local file with necessary environment variables for the Roast My Wallet app.

Requirements:
- Include ANTHROPIC_API_KEY with a placeholder
- Include NEXT_PUBLIC_FLOW_RPC_URL with Flow testnet RPC
- Add helpful comments explaining each variable
- Include a note about getting API keys

Content should be:
```
# Anthropic Claude API Key
# Get your key at: https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# Flow EVM RPC URL (public endpoint)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FLOW_RPC_URL=https://testnet.evm.nodes.onflow.org

# Optional: WalletConnect Project ID (if using WalletConnect)
# Get your project ID at: https://cloud.walletconnect.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLET_CONNECT_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id_here
```

Create this file if it doesn't exist. If it exists, append these variables (avoiding duplicates).
